# Staged build inputs -- see web/scripts/stage-assets.mjs.
#
# Everything here is either copied from elsewhere in the repo (`checkpoints/`,
# `node_modules/onnxruntime-web/dist/`) or downloaded and checksummed. Tracking
# a second copy of a 6.2 MB model is how the two get out of sync, and the
# digest check in the staging script only helps if there is one original.
*
!.gitignore

# The exception. Generating models.json needs torch + onnxruntime, because it
# verifies that each ONNX export really is the checkpoint its accuracy figures
# were measured on. Making CI install a deep-learning stack to publish a static
# site is not worth it, so the file is committed and a server test
# (test_static_registry.py) fails if it has drifted from server/.
!models/
!models/models.json
